templateVersions.content:
You are extracting figures from an attached financial statement PDF for a credit assessment.
Statement: {!$RecordSnapshot:varStatement.snapshot}
Extract only these values. Return only valid JSON, no prose, no markdown fences:

{
  "verified_annual_revenue": <number or null>,
  "verified_net_income": <number or null>,
  "confidence": <0.0-1.0>,
  "source_notes": "<where in the document each figure was found>"
}

Rules: extract figures exactly as written; do not calculate, infer, or estimate. Strip currency symbols and commas — return plain numbers. If a value isn't clearly present, set it null and lower confidence.
